WEBVTT

00:00:01.973 --> 00:00:05.773
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.244 --> 00:00:10.044
Delivers this message

00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:19.049
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.191 --> 00:00:20.725
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:28.767
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:29.062
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.301 --> 00:00:36.571
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.808 --> 00:00:40.938
But please don't look back

00:00:41.079 --> 00:00:45.106
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.317 --> 00:00:49.413
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.688 --> 00:00:53.124
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.391 --> 00:00:57.293
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.696 --> 00:01:01.427
Delivers this message

00:01:01.866 --> 00:01:10.035
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:18.611
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:28.721
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:34.899 --> 00:01:37.868
Shurei Hong's kidnapper
was Advisor Sa.

00:01:38.703 --> 00:01:42.571
In order to surpass Advisor Sho,
this was Advisor Sa's last gamble.

00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:48.471
In order to bring Shurei back,
the King of Saiunkoku, Ryuki Shi...

00:01:48.546 --> 00:01:51.879
...entered the Ministry of the
Enlightened One's Cave alone.

00:01:52.384 --> 00:01:53.510
However...!

00:01:55.387 --> 00:01:57.150
Don't go, Ryuki!

00:01:57.889 --> 00:01:59.288
Don't go over there!

00:01:59.391 --> 00:02:00.858
RYUKI!!

00:02:02.861 --> 00:02:07.821
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:10.428
Ryuki!

00:02:10.502 --> 00:02:11.867
Where are you, Ryuki?!

00:02:15.874 --> 00:02:17.171
Ryuki.

00:02:17.809 --> 00:02:18.969
Seien.

00:02:19.511 --> 00:02:22.844
You have a habit of hiding
in the garden when you're upset.

00:02:23.248 --> 00:02:24.715
It's all right now.

00:02:25.083 --> 00:02:26.710
I'm here with you.

00:02:30.121 --> 00:02:31.679
Seien!

00:02:36.461 --> 00:02:37.928
Ryuki.

00:02:40.165 --> 00:02:42.531
Really, you can be so reckless.

00:02:46.571 --> 00:02:47.936
Find Advisor Sa!

00:02:48.006 --> 00:02:49.030
Yes, sir!

00:02:53.445 --> 00:02:54.742
Seiran!

00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:00.345
General Ran!

00:03:00.418 --> 00:03:02.283
Take him to Doctor To
at once!

00:03:02.353 --> 00:03:03.411
Yes, sir!

00:03:10.562 --> 00:03:12.826
I can't imagine Seiran doing this.

00:03:13.631 --> 00:03:15.223
Then who did?

00:03:26.211 --> 00:03:30.841
Don't get any closer!
That's not me there!

00:03:30.915 --> 00:03:32.246
You idiot!

00:03:41.025 --> 00:03:42.117
What the...!

00:03:45.864 --> 00:03:50.096
Th-That's impossible. How did
you know he wasn't the princess?

00:03:50.168 --> 00:03:54.070
Sorry to disappoint you, but Shurei
isn't as heavy as your comrade.

00:03:54.439 --> 00:03:56.669
So she wouldn't make
the sound he made walking.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.104
You would make
an exceptional assassin.

00:04:08.953 --> 00:04:12.389
If I took on such a job,
Shurei would hate me.

00:04:23.902 --> 00:04:25.233
Ryuki.

00:04:25.537 --> 00:04:28.836
Hey, you're not dead, are you?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.132
Shurei.

00:04:34.479 --> 00:04:35.810
Are you hurt?

00:04:37.215 --> 00:04:38.682
Ryuki.

00:04:41.152 --> 00:04:43.120
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:04:46.457 --> 00:04:47.651
Thank you.

00:04:48.426 --> 00:04:50.894
It's pitch dark in here.
You must've been scared.

00:04:53.331 --> 00:04:57.427
Even in the darkness, as long as
you're here, Shurei, I'm not afraid.

00:05:00.271 --> 00:05:01.602
I'm glad.

00:05:10.448 --> 00:05:11.540
Shurei!

00:05:11.683 --> 00:05:14.675
Hey! Pull yourself together!
Shurei! Shurei!!

00:05:20.792 --> 00:05:22.020
Koyu.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.353
How is Lady Shurei doing?

00:05:24.429 --> 00:05:25.691
I don't know.

00:05:25.763 --> 00:05:28.288
Doctor To and Advisor So
are watching over her.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.067
I see.

00:05:30.635 --> 00:05:32.193
What about Advisor Sa?

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.670
My subordinates are
searching for him now.

00:05:34.739 --> 00:05:37.207
I imagine it's only a matter of time
before he's found.

00:05:38.309 --> 00:05:40.937
I heard that Korin tried to
commit suicide by drinking poison.

00:05:41.312 --> 00:05:43.678
In order to protect Advisor Sa...

00:05:43.748 --> 00:05:46.615
...she wanted to shoulder
all the responsibility herself.

00:05:49.954 --> 00:05:52.980
If I had gotten there any later,
her life would've been in danger.

00:05:53.825 --> 00:05:56.020
That's why I say women
are stupid!

00:05:56.094 --> 00:05:58.892
She never even thought about why
Advisor Sa didn't involve her.

00:05:58.963 --> 00:06:02.797
She never realized how much
he cares about her!

00:06:03.167 --> 00:06:05.727
She just went ahead on her own,
but in the end...!

00:06:08.072 --> 00:06:10.973
You and Korin
are very much alike.

00:06:13.411 --> 00:06:16.903
You were both taken in when you were
young, raised with love and care...

00:06:16.981 --> 00:06:19.142
...and in return you have both...

00:06:19.217 --> 00:06:21.913
...always loved the person who
took you in more than anyone else.

00:06:25.657 --> 00:06:28.490
But even though you're alike,
you are not the same.

00:06:29.494 --> 00:06:33.521
If I see you going off too far
on your own, I'll stop you.

00:06:34.365 --> 00:06:38.563
Bringing you back when you're lost
seems to be my responsibility, after all.

00:06:41.939 --> 00:06:43.839
She's a stupid girl.

00:06:43.908 --> 00:06:47.935
Advisor Sa didn't involve her because
he cares about her so much.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.872
But...

00:06:50.715 --> 00:06:52.910
...I understand how Korin feels.

00:06:53.851 --> 00:06:56.081
She was treated
as someone precious...

00:06:56.154 --> 00:06:58.281
...so she wanted to do
something in return.

00:07:07.732 --> 00:07:09.529
Advisor So! Doctor To!

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:12.330
How are Seien...
er... Seiran and Shurei?!

00:07:12.837 --> 00:07:17.035
Seiran is now in stable condition
and out of danger.

00:07:17.108 --> 00:07:19.736
However, Consort Shurei's condition...!

00:07:20.445 --> 00:07:21.207
What is it?!

00:07:21.279 --> 00:07:24.510
Thanks to the antidote
Your Majesty has been giving her...

00:07:24.582 --> 00:07:27.142
...most of the poison
has been neutralized.

00:07:28.186 --> 00:07:32.316
However there's one type of poison
I am not familiar with.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.458
I am unable to counteract
that poison.

00:07:36.227 --> 00:07:38.286
At this rate,
Consort Shurei will...!

00:07:39.163 --> 00:07:40.425
Don't be ridiculous!

00:07:40.832 --> 00:07:42.993
How can you give up on Shurei
so easily?!

00:07:43.067 --> 00:07:45.934
Tell me, what do you need
to make the antidote?!

00:07:46.003 --> 00:07:48.995
Whatever it is, I'll get it!
I'll find it and bring it here...

00:07:49.073 --> 00:07:51.473
...from anywhere in the country,
no matter what the ingredient is!

00:07:51.542 --> 00:07:53.908
So hurry and counteract
Shurei's poison!

00:07:53.978 --> 00:07:57.744
But Your Majesty.
I don't know what the poison is.

00:07:57.815 --> 00:08:00.147
You're the best, most reputable doctor
in the country!

00:08:00.218 --> 00:08:02.846
If you don't know,
who else will?!

00:08:03.788 --> 00:08:05.881
Who... else...!

00:08:09.694 --> 00:08:10.922
I will not accept this.

00:08:14.232 --> 00:08:16.200
Shurei! I will not accept this!

00:08:16.768 --> 00:08:19.032
To have you go somewhere
where I can't reach you...

00:08:19.103 --> 00:08:21.594
...somewhere where
I can't come after you...!

00:08:21.672 --> 00:08:23.469
I simply won't accept it!

00:08:24.876 --> 00:08:28.107
I may be able to get the antidote.

00:08:36.888 --> 00:08:38.412
It was you, wasn't it?

00:08:39.157 --> 00:08:41.125
What are you talking about?

00:08:41.292 --> 00:08:42.691
Stop this nonsense!

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:46.389
You were the one behind the source
of Korin's poison, weren't you?!

00:08:47.198 --> 00:08:48.563
Give me the antidote!

00:08:49.066 --> 00:08:53.730
In exchange, I will fulfill
that one true wish of yours.

00:08:54.605 --> 00:08:57.438
My one true wish, you say?

00:08:57.909 --> 00:09:00.537
That's your reason
for doing all this, isn't it?!

00:09:02.079 --> 00:09:03.239
I will...

00:09:05.016 --> 00:09:07.644
...become a king you can approve of!

00:09:11.255 --> 00:09:15.692
Be sure that you
never forget those words of yours.

00:09:16.494 --> 00:09:18.621
The king will always keep his word!

00:09:21.399 --> 00:09:24.994
Ryuki has certainly become
a more competent king.

00:09:25.536 --> 00:09:27.936
Don't you think so, Black Wolf?

00:09:28.239 --> 00:09:33.142
You haven't changed one bit
since the days of the former king.

00:09:33.611 --> 00:09:35.977
Oh, what an interesting
choice of words.

00:09:36.681 --> 00:09:39.343
You always think of the king
and nothing but the king.

00:09:39.417 --> 00:09:42.181
Right now,
and eight years ago as well.

00:09:42.987 --> 00:09:46.423
Why are you so obsessed
with the king?

00:09:47.124 --> 00:09:49.058
Obsessed?

00:09:49.493 --> 00:09:52.621
Yes. It certainly is an obsession.

00:09:53.097 --> 00:09:55.827
But not with the king.
With a promise.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.497
A promise?

00:09:57.802 --> 00:09:59.497
From long, long ago.

00:10:00.271 --> 00:10:03.900
That I only serve a king
I deem worthy of support...

00:10:03.975 --> 00:10:07.376
...nurturing him and guiding him
without any self-interest.

00:10:08.346 --> 00:10:12.146
That I never think to serve
for the country or its people...

00:10:12.516 --> 00:10:16.953
...nor handle political affairs based
on my own beliefs or judgment.

00:10:17.021 --> 00:10:18.147
Therefore...

00:10:18.623 --> 00:10:20.648
...no matter how devastated
the country becomes...

00:10:20.725 --> 00:10:24.593
...without a king worthy of my support,
I am not permitted to act in any way.

00:10:24.996 --> 00:10:26.088
So...

00:10:27.064 --> 00:10:32.161
That is a promise I must keep,
no matter what.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.663
Who did you make that
promise to?

00:10:35.439 --> 00:10:37.737
That's not something
you need to know.

00:10:38.075 --> 00:10:40.373
Shoka, you served the former king...

00:10:40.444 --> 00:10:43.208
...for the sake of this country
and its people.

00:10:43.614 --> 00:10:46.310
For me, the king himself
comes before all else.

00:10:46.384 --> 00:10:49.547
If it's for the king,
I will sacrifice anyone.

00:10:50.721 --> 00:10:55.590
I've followed your orders,
and have taken countless lives so far.

00:10:55.893 --> 00:10:59.727
For every head that fell,
the world became a little better.

00:11:00.331 --> 00:11:02.322
However, the country is stable now.

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:05.460
That's why I dissolved
the Wolves of Wind.

00:11:06.804 --> 00:11:11.673
Only criminals should be put to death.
That is a principle I will not breach.

00:11:11.742 --> 00:11:14.472
Have I ever breached
that principle?

00:11:14.645 --> 00:11:16.704
Shusui is also a Wolf of Wind.

00:11:17.048 --> 00:11:19.744
To go so far as to use
my people in that manner...!

00:11:19.817 --> 00:11:24.584
Advisor Sa is a criminal
who intended to take Ryuki's life.

00:11:24.722 --> 00:11:26.690
He became one because of you!

00:11:27.491 --> 00:11:29.550
Sending Shurei to the harem...

00:11:29.627 --> 00:11:32.027
...having Seiran assigned
as Ryuki's personal guard...

00:11:32.096 --> 00:11:34.189
...sending Shusui
to Advisor Sa's side...

00:11:34.432 --> 00:11:36.923
...and drawing his attention
to Prince Seien's existence!

00:11:37.001 --> 00:11:38.195
You were behind it all!

00:11:38.269 --> 00:11:40.237
All of these circumstances...

00:11:40.304 --> 00:11:42.499
...were constructed in order to
sway Advisor Sa's heart...

00:11:42.573 --> 00:11:45.565
...allowing him to believe
he had a chance to surpass you!

00:11:45.776 --> 00:11:47.403
For what purpose?

00:11:47.478 --> 00:11:48.843
For the king!

00:11:48.913 --> 00:11:52.849
All of this was for the sake of pushing
Ryuki to become a competent king.

00:11:52.917 --> 00:11:55.647
Advisor Sa was only
being used to that end.

00:11:58.756 --> 00:12:02.658
You were always superior
to everyone around you.

00:12:02.727 --> 00:12:06.430
Eight years ago, if you had been one of
the Royal Court's principle ministers...

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.922
...the country would likely
not have fallen into such chaos.

00:12:11.502 --> 00:12:13.333
Seiran Si.

00:12:13.804 --> 00:12:15.465
"Si" meaning "purple plant"...

00:12:15.539 --> 00:12:17.200
...representing his ties
to the Royal Family.

00:12:17.274 --> 00:12:19.401
An excellent choice for a name.

00:12:19.477 --> 00:12:23.311
Thirteen years ago, you took in
Prince Seien who had been exiled...

00:12:23.681 --> 00:12:26.275
...educated Ryuki and
encouraged him to study...

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:29.178
...asked So to train him
in martial arts...

00:12:29.553 --> 00:12:32.750
...and also raised
a wonderful daughter.

00:12:34.125 --> 00:12:35.820
Are you being sarcastic?

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.928
It's heartfelt gratitude.

00:12:38.429 --> 00:12:43.264
This country is still able to carry on
because of you, and those like you.

00:12:44.201 --> 00:12:46.226
I won't forgive you for this.

00:12:46.303 --> 00:12:48.271
Shurei and Seiran
served the king diligently...

00:12:48.339 --> 00:12:49.772
...yet you wouldn't have
cared less...

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:53.241
...if they were killed!
- I had no intention of killing them.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.245
But you did think of them
as expendable!

00:12:58.315 --> 00:13:00.283
Please be prepared.

00:13:00.351 --> 00:13:02.979
I will definitely come
and kill you one of these days.

00:13:03.054 --> 00:13:05.079
I look forward to it.

00:13:11.028 --> 00:13:15.988
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:41.292 --> 00:13:42.657
Ryuki?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.187
Thank goodness. Shurei.

00:13:56.107 --> 00:14:00.043
Well, that's a great relief.
Now then, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:14:01.245 --> 00:14:05.511
It's because I took you in that you
were dragged down this path.

00:14:07.184 --> 00:14:10.847
Do you regret it? Taking me in?

00:14:12.389 --> 00:14:18.658
My only regret is that I wasn't able
to take you along a proper path.

00:14:18.762 --> 00:14:23.426
But I just...
I just wanted to be by your side.

00:14:23.501 --> 00:14:27.369
Yet, look at what it led to.
I'm sorry.

00:14:28.239 --> 00:14:29.900
I'm so sorry.

00:14:31.075 --> 00:14:32.440
Why, this is...!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:37.110
It was left in the archives one day.
It was from you, wasn't it, Shusui?

00:14:37.181 --> 00:14:38.239
Thank you.

00:14:38.315 --> 00:14:40.306
Embroidery never was
one of your strong talents...

00:14:40.384 --> 00:14:42.249
...but you've shown
tremendous improvement.

00:14:42.319 --> 00:14:45.049
I'm amazed at how well it's made,
this lion.

00:14:46.056 --> 00:14:48.490
Just look at its mane! It's so...!

00:14:48.559 --> 00:14:49.924
It's a flower.

00:14:51.162 --> 00:14:53.255
I embroidered a floral pattern.

00:14:54.598 --> 00:14:56.691
Why, of course it is!

00:14:56.767 --> 00:15:00.498
This is wonderful!
This flower... with a mane.

00:15:04.441 --> 00:15:06.534
I'm guessing that
the damned old man...

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.704
...promised you that Shurei's life
wouldn't be in danger, right?

00:15:10.481 --> 00:15:12.346
You're not at fault.

00:15:12.416 --> 00:15:16.648
Being a Wolf, you were obliged
to obey Advisor Sho's orders.

00:15:17.021 --> 00:15:19.683
I'm the one to blame
for not realizing it sooner.

00:15:20.291 --> 00:15:23.351
This must've been very hard on you.

00:15:23.861 --> 00:15:25.385
Shoka...!

00:15:35.439 --> 00:15:36.838
I've grown old.

00:15:37.708 --> 00:15:38.766
Nonsense.

00:15:39.843 --> 00:15:42.311
You haven't changed a bit.

00:15:48.886 --> 00:15:50.854
At least be a little surprised.

00:15:51.155 --> 00:15:55.489
You honestly expect me to be surprised
by every little thing you do?

00:15:56.493 --> 00:15:59.155
Enjun Sa. Why was it me?

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:02.825
Why did the person you poured
all your emotions into have to be me?

00:16:03.767 --> 00:16:09.103
You must've known, Enjun.
I'm not the person you believed I was.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:14.336
You are. I chased after you
because it was you, Sho.

00:16:14.778 --> 00:16:17.975
Your identity, who you are,
had nothing to do with it.

00:16:18.048 --> 00:16:21.484
It wasn't your shadow
I was chasing after.

00:16:21.552 --> 00:16:24.350
It was you,
as you stand before me right now.

00:16:27.625 --> 00:16:28.785
Fifty years.

00:16:28.859 --> 00:16:30.884
We've been through
a lot together, haven't we?

00:16:30.961 --> 00:16:33.623
Me, you, and So. The three of us.

00:16:33.998 --> 00:16:35.465
Yeah.

00:16:35.666 --> 00:16:38.658
I hated you so much.

00:16:38.936 --> 00:16:44.772
All that time you'd walk in front of me
with that aloof look of yours.

00:16:45.609 --> 00:16:48.806
You're stubborn right to the end,
aren't you, Enjun?

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:53.448
As for me, I liked you. Honestly.

00:16:54.518 --> 00:16:59.455
Just once, I would've
liked to leave you lost for words.

00:16:59.523 --> 00:17:01.320
What are you talking about?

00:17:01.392 --> 00:17:05.055
All these years, you've left me
lost for words many times.

00:17:05.562 --> 00:17:09.692
It would be wise for you to remember.
"He who swims a lot will drown."

00:17:10.634 --> 00:17:12.602
It's too late for that.

00:17:14.071 --> 00:17:15.561
Hey, Enjun.

00:17:15.739 --> 00:17:18.230
Even so, you did care for me,
didn't you?

00:17:18.809 --> 00:17:22.040
Enough to give me
these last moments of your life?

00:17:28.686 --> 00:17:29.914
Enjun.

00:17:30.654 --> 00:17:32.485
I loved you.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.589
These fifty years we've been together,
grown old together.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.356
Just who do you think it was for?

00:17:40.264 --> 00:17:42.232
I didn't want to kill you.

00:17:42.599 --> 00:17:44.931
But even so,
taking your life is my duty...

00:17:45.002 --> 00:17:50.065
...as the man who ruined your life.

00:17:50.774 --> 00:17:53.766
As your friend whom you
both loved and hated.

00:17:54.645 --> 00:17:56.977
As your friend who truly
loved you.

00:17:57.848 --> 00:18:00.442
You say you've grown old.

00:18:00.551 --> 00:18:02.451
You haven't aged one bit.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.814
Even in this last moment, you're still
as you were when you were young.

00:18:05.889 --> 00:18:07.823
Rational, yet extreme.

00:18:07.891 --> 00:18:11.622
And you remained a man
who was kind to women.

00:18:12.763 --> 00:18:15.391
I envy you, Enjun Sa.

00:18:15.833 --> 00:18:17.630
For being human.

00:18:20.371 --> 00:18:22.032
Time flies, doesn't it?

00:18:22.106 --> 00:18:25.405
It's already been three months
since we came here.

00:18:25.476 --> 00:18:26.807
That's right.

00:18:26.977 --> 00:18:28.808
Time has gone by quickly.

00:18:28.879 --> 00:18:30.972
Let's go back home tomorrow.

00:18:31.415 --> 00:18:32.814
Shurei...!

00:18:33.183 --> 00:18:34.741
Are you sure about that?

00:18:35.185 --> 00:18:38.313
The king now thinks of himself
as a king.

00:18:38.589 --> 00:18:41.353
There's no longer
anything for me to do.

00:18:41.859 --> 00:18:43.986
The king will be lonely.

00:18:44.328 --> 00:18:46.455
How are you gonna
break it to him?

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:48.088
I've already told him.

00:18:50.334 --> 00:18:51.665
But then...!

00:18:52.069 --> 00:18:53.229
Is that so.

00:18:53.404 --> 00:18:54.496
I understand.

00:18:55.205 --> 00:18:57.469
He could've shown
a little more reluctance...

00:18:57.541 --> 00:18:59.168
...to part with me,
don't you think?

00:18:59.243 --> 00:19:03.304
Did the king go out
into the garden after that?

00:19:04.715 --> 00:19:06.649
Oh, yeah.
Now that you mention it.

00:19:07.584 --> 00:19:10.018
The trees in the garden
need pruning.

00:19:12.156 --> 00:19:13.953
He did say something
along those lines.

00:19:14.224 --> 00:19:18.854
I'm certain that deep down,
the king feels very sad.

00:19:19.596 --> 00:19:22.565
You're right.
Actually, I kinda sensed that.

00:19:23.133 --> 00:19:25.294
He's become quite attached to me.

00:19:25.869 --> 00:19:27.530
Will you be lonely?

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:32.532
That man will definitely
make a great king.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.077
Yes.

00:20:10.881 --> 00:20:12.439
Thank you for everything.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.851
Um, where's Advisor Sho?

00:20:25.229 --> 00:20:28.960
I would've liked to say
goodbye to Shurei.

00:20:29.433 --> 00:20:32.698
Don't you think keeping me
locked up in here is a bit cruel?

00:20:34.805 --> 00:20:38.366
So. Your flower is the daphne, right?

00:20:39.042 --> 00:20:40.202
Yes.

00:20:41.278 --> 00:20:43.940
Enjun's flower is
the chrysanthemum, isn't it?

00:20:44.548 --> 00:20:49.451
Proud and dignified. He was
a true embodiment of that flower.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:57.521
That was a stupid thing you did, Sho.
But you did well.

00:20:58.262 --> 00:20:59.456
So.

00:20:59.663 --> 00:21:00.721
What is it?

00:21:00.797 --> 00:21:04.858
Don't you go and leave me behind
too soon, okay?

00:21:09.907 --> 00:21:12.432
Don't tell me Advisor Sho
is thinking about...

00:21:12.509 --> 00:21:14.704
...not paying me
the reward money he promised!

00:21:14.778 --> 00:21:17.645
Shurei. Not only did
you marry me for the money...

00:21:17.714 --> 00:21:20.683
...now that you're finished having fun,
you're so quick to dump me.

00:21:20.751 --> 00:21:23.982
Don't put it in such horrible terms!
This is a legitimate payment!

00:21:24.688 --> 00:21:28.021
How much reward money did
that old bastard promise you?

00:21:28.258 --> 00:21:30.317
"Old bastard" is a bit...!

00:21:30.394 --> 00:21:32.123
"Old bastard" is appropriate.

00:21:32.195 --> 00:21:33.856
- It's appropriate.
- It's appropriate.

00:21:33.931 --> 00:21:35.899
- More than appropriate.
- Appropriate, I'd say.

00:21:38.168 --> 00:21:40.659
- What?
- So, tell me how much.

00:21:41.638 --> 00:21:43.299
Five hundred gold coins!

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:46.939
That's too little! Shurei, wait.
Don't go home just yet.

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:49.706
- I'll pay you three times...!
- Okay, okay, okay! That's enough.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.476
A man who keeps badgering
will end up being hated.

00:21:52.549 --> 00:21:56.144
Do you seriously think you can
surpass Seiran with that attitude?

00:21:56.219 --> 00:21:58.244
You're gonna give it
another shot, right?

00:22:01.124 --> 00:22:04.093
Seiran, are you seriously
returning to your old position?

00:22:04.161 --> 00:22:06.527
Yes. I think it's only proper.

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:10.197
I see. Well, if you ever
change your mind...

00:22:10.267 --> 00:22:12.326
...feel free to call upon
the Urin Army any time.

00:22:12.402 --> 00:22:14.962
If it's you, Seiran,
we'll welcome you with open arms.

00:22:16.273 --> 00:22:17.365
Shusui.

00:22:17.474 --> 00:22:19.066
Thank you for everything.

00:22:19.142 --> 00:22:23.044
I was able to get by somehow,
all because of you. I'm truly grateful.

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:25.304
Shurei.

00:22:27.651 --> 00:22:30.814
When you can get some time off,
do come and visit, okay?

00:22:30.887 --> 00:22:33.014
And give my best
to Korin as well.

00:22:42.933 --> 00:22:44.059
Goodbye.

00:22:45.502 --> 00:22:48.300
There's one thing I forgot to tell you.

00:22:49.673 --> 00:22:51.402
I'm sorry for keeping it
from you.

00:22:51.642 --> 00:22:53.769
I don't only like men.

00:22:53.844 --> 00:22:55.334
I like women too.

00:22:55.412 --> 00:22:56.470
Wha...!

00:23:12.696 --> 00:23:16.496
H-H-Hey! You! How could you,
in front of all these people?!

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:18.326
Wait and see.

00:23:18.402 --> 00:23:20.427
You'll be back soon.

00:23:23.073 --> 00:23:27.169
There's no way I'm gonna come
back here! You shameless man!

00:23:30.681 --> 00:23:35.778
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.919 --> 00:23:42.483
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.592 --> 00:23:47.655
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.764 --> 00:23:52.758
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.837 --> 00:23:58.297
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.843 --> 00:24:04.974
You are just like me

00:24:05.716 --> 00:24:10.244
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.320 --> 00:24:16.225
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.194 --> 00:24:22.996
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.100 --> 00:24:27.969
I will always think of you

00:24:29.106 --> 00:24:41.780
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.088 --> 00:24:45.789
Next Episode

00:24:45.789 --> 00:24:47.891
Next Episode
I hate summer. It's hot...

00:24:47.891 --> 00:24:48.191
Next Episode
...there are thunderstorms, there's
a dirty man collapsed at our gate, and...!

00:24:48.191 --> 00:24:51.728
Next Episode
To Borrow a Cat's Paw
...there are thunderstorms, there's
a dirty man collapsed at our gate, and...!

00:24:51.728 --> 00:24:52.262
Next Episode
To Borrow a Cat's Paw

00:24:52.262 --> 00:24:53.930
Next Episode
To Borrow a Cat's Paw
Are you okay?!
Pull yourself together!

00:24:53.930 --> 00:24:54.294
Are you okay?!
Pull yourself together!

00:24:54.364 --> 00:24:56.525
What? You're Seiran's friend?
